{"version":1,"key":"card:600","content":{"id":600,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在 JavaScript 中是一个一元运算符，它会对后面的表达式执行进行，然后返回 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"void 0 // undefined\nvoid (1 + 2) // undefied\n\n// 立即执行函数\nvoid function() {\n  return 1 + 2\n}() // undefined","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"bf2356e6-7ff7-4452-af61-519f28b8c8c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在 TypeScript 是一种类型，用来表示函数没有返回值"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不等于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是函数返回值声明为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以返回 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不能将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的变量赋值给非 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的变量"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function hello(): void {\n  console.log(\"Hello World!\")\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"f255857d-59f3-4349-98cd-6d4c833bef73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那似乎 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以直接取代 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，为什么要发明 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这一类型呢？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在我已知的实践中 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是可以互换的，二者的区别可能是在语义上，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示函数无返回值，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示的是存在返回值，返回值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"void","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供了一种更加明确的语义，让人一眼就知道这个函数不返回任何内容。"}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/void","TypeScript/void","概念对比"],"createTime":1753056366157,"updateTime":1754033021144,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1754033021144}}